   One limitation remains and we state it plainly: our sweep covers
   node_count=3; we did not additionally test 1- or 5-node consortiums,
   which would isolate the marginal effect of consortium size itself
   (as opposed to block interval) on synchronization latency. We
   identify this as a direction for further empirical work."

